31,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Now that the first night has passed, we have a chance to gather information. If the Seer has discovered anything, please share it now so we can analyze the facts and determine our next move.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I wonder if our Seer has found anything helpful. Please, do tell us if you have, dear. We are all listening with such hope that we can find a way to keep everyone safe.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"If the Seer is among us, now is the time to speak. Please provide your findings clearly. I will be comparing your claim with the reactions of others to see if any inconsistencies emerge.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall step forward then. I divined Kenji last night, and I can confirm he is human. While a single piece of data is modest, it provides us with a reliable foundation to begin our deductions.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, Benjamin! Thank you so much for checking on me! That's so nice of you! I'm really glad I can be a helpful part of the team. I totally trust Benjamin, he's being so helpful!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Benjamin, thank you for the information. If we accept your claim as the Seer, Kenji is now a confirmed human. However, we must consider the possibility that a Werewolf is posing as the Seer to gain trust.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a bit frightening to think that someone might be lying to us, isn't it? But Benjamin has been so poised and helpful. I want to believe him, though I know we must be careful for the village's sake.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Kenji's reaction is predictably enthusiastic, but that doesn't prove Benjamin's claim. We must analyze if this ""confirmed human"" status is being used to create a false sense of security or to shield a potential accomplice.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A healthy dose of skepticism is precisely what I expect from you, Mizuki. It would be far too simple if we all blindly accepted my word. However, consider the risk: why would a wolf reveal a human so early?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! Benjamin is just trying to help us all! Why would he lie about me being human? I think we should trust him so we can find the real werewolf together! Let's stay positive, guys!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Let's look at the logic. If Benjamin is the Werewolf, he might be protecting Kenji to build a strong alliance. However, if he is the Seer, we have a confirmed human. We need to see if anyone else claims the Seer role.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is so difficult to decide when we care for each other so much. If anyone else feels they are the Seer, please speak up, dear. I would hate for us to make a mistake and hurt a kind soul.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If no one else claims the Seer role, Benjamin's claim becomes more plausible, but not certain. I'm more interested in how the others react to this. If a Possessed player is here, they might be overly eager to validate Benjamin's claim.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"An astute observation, Mizuki. Indeed, the Possessed often play the role of the most fervent supporter. I shall be quite interested to see who among us is perhaps a bit too eager to champion my cause.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, are you saying that being supportive is a bad thing? I just want us all to get along! I'm not being ""too eager,"" I'm just happy Benjamin is helping us! We should be cheering each other on!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Since no one else has claimed the Seer role, Benjamin's information is our only lead. However, we must remain objective. Let's evaluate the voting options based on the current evidence and the risk of a false Seer.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a heavy burden to decide who to vote for. I feel so sad that we must choose someone. Perhaps we should be very gentle with our decision, as I truly hope we don't hurt an innocent friend.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Gentleness won't find the werewolf, Shizue. If we have no contradictory claims, Benjamin is our best lead, but we must remain cautious. I'll be watching for any sudden shifts in behavior before we cast our votes.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we have reached the end of our discussion, I suggest we weigh the risks. While I am the only one claiming the Seer role, the most logical path is to trust the data provided—for now.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I agree with Benjamin! He's been so honest with us. Let's trust him and work together to find the werewolf. I'm sure if we stay positive and support each other, we'll win this!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
