64,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, my goodness... Minako is gone, and poor Mizuki was taken from us too. My heart just aches for our little group. How could such terrible things happen to such bright people?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A tragedy, indeed. However, we must not let grief cloud our judgment. The loss of two analytical minds is a significant blow, but it also narrows the field of suspects considerably.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"It's so sad that Minako and Mizuki are gone! I can't believe it! But Benjamin is right, we have to stay strong for them. We can still win this if we keep trusting each other!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I just can't imagine who would be so cruel. Benjamin dear, you are our only hope now. Please, tell us if your visions have revealed anything else that can help us end this nightmare.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is my unfortunate duty to inform you that my visions have revealed a darkness where I hoped for light. I divined Shizue last night, and the result was clear: she is the Werewolf.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"What?! Shizue? No way! She's always been so sweet and kind to everyone! Are you absolutely sure, Benjamin? I want to believe you because you've been so helpful, but this is such a shock!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Benjamin... how could you say such a thing? It breaks my heart to think you would believe I could be capable of such cruelty. I only wish for us all to be safe and happy.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Your kindness is a masterful performance, Shizue, but the divination does not lie. It is precisely that facade of sweetness that makes such a revelation so jarring, yet the logic remains immutable.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"This is so confusing! Shizue is always so nice to us, but Benjamin has been right so far. I don't want to believe it, but if Benjamin says so, we have to trust him, right?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am just a simple old woman who loves you all. It is so very sad that you would believe such a cold accusation over my heart. Please, Kenji dear, look into my eyes. Could I truly be a monster?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Appeal to emotion is the final refuge of the desperate, Shizue. Your eyes may be kind, but the truth is clinical. Kenji, do not let a gentle voice distract you from the evidence. We must act now.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm so sorry, Shizue, but Benjamin has been our guide this whole time! I really want to believe you're innocent, but we can't ignore the Seer's results. We have to do what's best for the village!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
